  "seoBody": "<h2>What Quickler is</h2><h3>Do I need a new app?</h3><p>Do you have WhatsApp? No new app needed. Do you have Telegram? No new app needed. Have neither? Time to join the more than 3 billion people on WhatsApp, or the more than 1 billion on Telegram.</p><h3>What happens when I say done?</h3><p>Quickler writes the report from everything you sent. You read it, change any word, and send it.</p><h3>Can it fill in my own report?</h3><p>Yes. Send a finished report in Word or PDF. Every new one comes back in that layout, with your headings, tables and logo.</p><h3>How is it different from SimPro, Joblogic or Fergus?</h3><p>It is narrower. It does not schedule jobs, send invoices or dispatch anyone. It turns a WhatsApp chat into your report. You still sign.</p><h2>Can I trust it?</h2><h3>Does it make things up?</h3><p>No. Every name and number in the report comes from something you said, sent or photographed. If two answers clash, it asks a person.</p><h3>Can the AI get it wrong?</h3><p>It can. So nothing is filed until you say done, and anything it cannot settle is raised with you, not guessed. Quickler knows only what is said in that chat, plus your Check. If you did not say it, Quickler will not make it up.</p><h3>What happens to Faults?</h3><p>Each Fault is listed with its place. Each one becomes a job on the To do list.</p><h2>Your work</h2><h3>How big can a report be?</h3><p>A big fire risk assessment can run to over 380 questions. A Record holds up to 250 photos and 50 documents.</p><h3>How much time does it save?</h3><p>One customer's write-up went from 1 to 2 hours to 12 to 22 minutes. The walk is the same. The desk work shrinks. We are still making it faster.</p><h3>What do I get at the end?</h3><p>Word, PDF, a web link, Excel, CSV or an action plan.</p><h2>Price</h2><h3>What does Quickler cost?</h3><p>£75 a month for each phone number on the account. Everyone else can read the reports, use the dashboard, share and download for free. Paid accounts have no limits on reports, photos or messages. Billed monthly by UK Direct Debit, or by purchase order if you need one: email <a href=\"mailto:purchaseorder@quickler.co\">purchaseorder@quickler.co</a>. See the <a href=\"/pages/services.html#pricing\">pricing page</a>.</p><h3>Do I need a card to start?</h3><p>No. Start with 14 days free, with everything unlocked. <a href=\"https://app.quickler.co/signup\">Start free trial</a>.</p><h2>Your data</h2><h3>Where are records stored?</h3><p>On EU servers. You can download or delete records on request.</p><h3>Is Quickler GDPR compliant?</h3><p>Quickler is registered with the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO registration ZC124993). Data is held on EU servers under a Data Processing Agreement.</p><h3>Who owns the data?</h3><p>You do. Quickler is the processor and you are the controller. If you leave, you can download every record and we delete our copy.</p><h3>Can I download records?</h3><p>Yes, any time, as PDF, Word, Excel, CSV or a web page.</p>",
